{
  "info": {
    "name": "local-life-microservices · Nacos 接入测试",
    "description": "黑马点评微服务改造 - Nacos 注册中心/配置中心接入后的端到端测试。\n\n前置条件：\n1. Nacos 容器已启动（127.0.0.1:8848，本机 localhost→IPv6 会超时，务必用 127.0.0.1）。\n2. user-service(8081)、gateway(8080) 已启动，且三份配置已发布到 Nacos（shared-redis.yaml / user-service.yaml / gateway.yaml）。\n\n使用说明：\n- 「发送验证码」不会返回验证码，需要从 Redis（docker exec redis7 redis-cli GET \"login:code:13800138000\"）或 user-service 控制台日志里拿到 6 位验证码，填入集合变量 code。\n- 「登录」成功后会自动把返回的 token 写入集合变量 token，后续鉴权请求直接使用 {{token}}。\n- 集合变量：phone=13800138000（默认）、code=123456（占位，改成真实验证码）、token=自动填充。",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "nacosUrl",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:8848",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "phone",
      "value": "13800138000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "code",
      "value": "123456",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Nacos 注册 / 配置中心检查",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Nacos 就绪",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{nacosUrl}}/nacos/v1/console/health/readiness"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Nacos 就绪（返回 OK）', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.include('OK'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "服务列表（应含 gateway + user-service）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{nacosUrl}}/nacos/v1/ns/service/list?pageNo=1&pageSize=10"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const doms = pm.response.json().doms || [];",
                  "pm.test('已注册服务含 user-service', () => pm.expect(doms).to.include('user-service'));",
                  "pm.test('已注册服务含 gateway', () => pm.expect(doms).to.include('gateway'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "user-service 实例详情（healthy=true）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{nacosUrl}}/nacos/v1/ns/instance/list?serviceName=user-service"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const hosts = pm.response.json().hosts || [];",
                  "pm.test('存在已注册实例', () => pm.expect(hosts.length).to.be.above(0));",
                  "pm.test('实例 healthy=true', () => pm.expect(hosts[0].healthy).to.be.true);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "读配置 gateway.yaml（白名单 + 路由）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{nacosUrl}}/nacos/v1/cs/configs?dataId=gateway.yaml&group=DEFAULT_GROUP"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "读配置 user-service.yaml（datasource + mybatis-plus）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{nacosUrl}}/nacos/v1/cs/configs?dataId=user-service.yaml&group=DEFAULT_GROUP"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "读配置 shared-redis.yaml（共享 Redis）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{nacosUrl}}/nacos/v1/cs/configs?dataId=shared-redis.yaml&group=DEFAULT_GROUP"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "1. 业务链路（经网关）",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "发送验证码",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/user/code?phone={{phone}}"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('发送成功 success=true', () => pm.expect(data.success).to.be.true);",
                  "console.log('验证码请从 Redis 或 user-service 日志获取，再填到集合变量 code');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "登录（自动保存 token）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\",\n  \"code\": \"{{code}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/user/login"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data && data.success) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', data.data);",
                  "    pm.test('登录成功，token 已写入集合变量', () => pm.expect(data.data).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "} else {",
                  "    pm.test('登录失败：' + (data && data.errorMsg || '未知'), () => pm.expect(data.success).to.be.true);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "鉴权访问 /user/me（带 token）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "authorization",
                "value": "{{token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/user/me"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('鉴权成功返回用户信息', () => pm.expect(data.success).to.be.true);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "无 token 访问 /user/me（预期 401）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/user/me"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('未登录应返回 401', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "登出",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "authorization",
                "value": "{{token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/user/logout"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('登出成功 success=true', () => pm.expect(data.success).to.be.true);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "登出后再访问 /user/me（预期 401）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "authorization",
                "value": "{{token}}",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/user/me"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('登出后 token 失效应返回 401', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
